<section class=\"philosophy\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / Our point of view</span><div><h2>Enough space.<br>The right light.<br>Room for life to happen.</h2><p>We begin by listening: to the people, to the place, and to what a building already offers. Often, the best answer is a careful adjustment rather than a bigger footprint.</p></div></div></section>
<div class=\"wrap\"><section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"home-services\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / How we can help</span><h2 id=\"home-services\">A thoughtful next chapter.</h2></div></div><div class=\"service-columns\"><article class=\"service-column\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">01 / Renew</span><h3>Renovations</h3><p>Rework the plan, welcome the daylight, and keep the character. A fresh way to live in a familiar place.</p>{link('single_services_preview.html','Explore renovations')}</article><article class=\"service-column\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / Make</span><h3>Compact homes</h3><p>Careful proportions and hardworking rooms. New homes shaped around daily rituals and a lighter footprint.</p>{link('services_preview.html#compact-homes','Explore new homes')}</article><article class=\"service-column\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / Gather</span><h3>Civic interiors</h3><p>Welcoming rooms for reading, making, meeting, and sharing. Small public places with an open invitation.</p>{link('services_preview.html#civic-interiors','Explore shared spaces')}</article></div></section></div>'''
